Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Predict m6A RNA Modification Sites from Sequence and Genomic Features
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Zhicheng", family = "Ruan",
           email = "Zhicheng.Ruan24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a trained random forest model together with functions to
    predict whether an adenosine is an m6A site from seven sequence and genomic
    features. Supports batch prediction from a feature table and single-site
    prediction with a user-defined probability threshold.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: randomForest, stats
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
